OL,3,GNEWSAEx-football chief admits offences
OL,4,Alinked to woman's drugging and rape by
OL,5,Ahusband
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former football club chief executive
OL,8,Fhas pleaded guilty to offences relating
OL,9,Fto the drugging and raping of a woman
OL,10,Fby her husband and others.
OL,12,FKarl Lindsay, 56, who resigned from
OL,13,Fnon-league Taunton Town Football Club
OL,14,Fin Somerset before he was charged, has
OL,15,Fadmitted the offences, which happened
OL,16,Fbetween 2015 and 2025.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
