OL,6,
OL,7,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court
OL,8,Fheard Lindsay's offending related to
OL,9,Fthe rape of the woman by her husband
OL,10,Fand others in the Stockport area of
OL,11,FGreater Manchester, and the
OL,12,Fadministration of substances to stupefy
OL,13,Fher for the purpose of sexual acts.
OL,15,FThe woman's husband, who is in his 60s
OL,16,Fand cannot be named to protect his
OL,17,Fwife's anonymity, has already admitted
OL,18,F62 offences against his wife, including
OL,19,Frape.
